{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9cMawkey The Last Macaw is a 2D pixel art adventure in which we control Mawkey, trying to prevent the destruction of the environment and the mistreatment of animals in Honduras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deforestation and fires caused by the evil businessman Adreim lead to the extinction of all the scarlet macaws in Honduras, leaving Mawkey alone on his journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This game is inspired by games like: Rayman, Donkey Kong and Mario Bros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We will have a total of 5 Bosses throughout the game, making it a somewhat challenging game for those casual players looking for a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game reflects what is happening in the world today, something that we humans do not see and do not want to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mawkey\u2019s Allies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Mawkey will meet five animals who will help him pass various levels. Their names are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colimbus: The Emerald Hummingbird. He will help you by revealing the hidden cages where hunters have captured several exotic Honduran parrots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trukki: The strongest toucan in his family. He can hold Mawkey to prevent him from falling into the void between the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xerothillo: This little friend helps you shrink to fit into small spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyo: A dove with a lot of flow that will allow you to run at incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mowsy: The white bat in charge of guiding you with his echolocation through extremely dark caves where nothing can be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please support this project by adding it to your wishlist.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My First Chamba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/cb5b85661c334c6c61c13578728f186a8fbacc91.jpg"},{"name":"Big Talker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/6ee46c52840183dd144224845755b88ee55b00a0.jpg"},{"name":"Ashes Remain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/f052e2ba1cfdc5d5e7540afd3ae2d161ccb8684a.jpg"},{"name":"Woodymachinegun!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/4a612dc4308ada8bbf96137224d0259f3cc7af99.jpg"},{"name":"JAMPEDRO!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/e3d8e9b512bee51d943891b605625d087025f896.jpg"},{"name":"Fight Over Cars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/b850f51a54439147f9ea86f8c63e062ffa253d17.jpg"},{"name":"Wings of Steel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/33a8fd0c4b387d2ce55b654ad8a9a11c1ea35195.jpg"},{"name":"I Am the Original","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/e4c4df7e9b9881905096fdeb6b328538a97f083b.jpg"},{"name":"Not With My Eggs!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/2a28ee686de8fe70b53a75ac4236bee500c1190e.jpg"},{"name":"Submadreada","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921580/6aec89e99c991a74e20015440dce2812ea0daadf.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921580?t=1768335487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/9c7dd0e4e43928d2bd721f9bbdfff9890b1e2cb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768335487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/b94b773dca82d627b9524e3bf30a3146ed34ecd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768335487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/b94b773dca82d627b9524e3bf30a3146ed34ecd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768335487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9cMawkey The Last Macaw is a 2D pixel art adventure in which we control Mawkey, trying to prevent the destruction of the environment and the mistreatment of animals in Honduras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam