44ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We will have a total of 5 Bosses throughout the game, making it a somewhat challenging game for those casual players looking for a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game reflects what is happening in the world today, something that we humans do not see and do not want to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mawkey\u2019s Allies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Mawkey will meet five animals who will help him pass various levels. Their names are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colimbus: The Emerald Hummingbird. He will help you by revealing the hidden cages where hunters have captured several exotic Honduran parrots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trukki: The strongest toucan in his family. He can hold Mawkey to prevent him from falling into the void between the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xerothillo: This little friend helps you shrink to fit into small spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyo: A dove with a lot of flow that will allow you to run at incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mowsy: The white bat in charge of guiding you with his echolocation through extremely dark caves where nothing can be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.poster.avif?t=1768335487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.webm?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.mp4?t=1768335487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please support this project by adding it to your wishlist.</p>","developers":["Guerra Pixel Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/b48e420b42b2fc03d24f73c8f4129fcf186fd32f/header.jpg?t=1768335487","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Mawkey The Last Macaw \u00a9 2025 Eduardo Manrrique Duron Guerra. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\"Mawkey\" and \"Guerra Pixel Studio\" are trademarks of Eduardo Guerra.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped with GameMaker Studio 2.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921580/334529825/21eaccd8bcf1c4b81006316498c5cdce829cc315/1753996573/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754105193","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921580/334529825/21eaccd8bcf1c4b81006316498c5cdce829cc315/1753996573/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754105193","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921580/334529825/21eaccd8bcf1c4b81006316498c5cdce829cc315/1753996573/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754105193","id":257176355,"name":"Mawkey Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176355/8309037ad4299f90bb76b894d5879f4839499eec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754105193"